{"2725800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "StableBound", "steam_appid": 2725800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/9a739e637a7bac9a3bf54927ee48f26c.webp?t=1784002233\" width=574 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, bond with, train, and breed your dream horse in StableBound — a horse life adventure where every horse has unique genetics, personalities, and potential. Explore vibrant landscapes, compete for rewards, discover rare horses, and build the stable you’ve always wanted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/84c011d8aec7a2cd6fd0095ac58f73e5.avif?t=1784002233\" width=681 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your horse and put your skills to the test in a variety of events. Earn rewards, gain experience, and strengthen your horse as you progress together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Compete in Dressage, Racing, Jumping, and Barrel Racing<br>• Earn currency and prizes<br>• Level up your horse through gameplay<br>• Improve stats including Speed, Strength, Agility, and Stamina<br>• Climb leaderboards and pursue champion status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/dda7461c30b5d350b1d5a1fcf03022f1.avif?t=1784002233\" width=759 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a stable filled with horses that feel alive. Care for their needs, strengthen your bond, and discover future generations through genetics-based breeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Feed, groom, and care for your horses<br>• Manage stable spaces and growing collections<br>• Breed horses with inherited genetics<br>• Discover rare colors, patterns, and combinations<br>• Watch personalities evolve as bonds deepen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/87ff2acf527bb22f5ef664953e22e6f8.avif?t=1784002233\" width=602 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander beautiful meadows and uncover surprises throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Catch new horses in the wild<br>• Discover hidden collectibles and dig spots<br>• Explore colorful environments<br>• Complete whims and activities<br>• Find rare rewards and secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/2438df7d6f1f4ae72bbe25d6acc86f42.webp?t=1784002233\" width=776 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create horses that feel uniquely yours with deep appearance options and genetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customize colors, markings, and patterns<br>• Discover genetics-based coat inheritance<br>• Unlock rare combinations<br>• Build your dream stable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/3dc0599552dcbba8e0b4f89d5f4c75e9.webp?t=1784002233\" width=204 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both relaxing and rewarding gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Controller support<br>• Day/night atmosphere<br>• Horse personalities and behaviors<br>• Animated environments with dynamic movement<br>• Progression systems and leveling<br>• Casual and long-term gameplay goals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/9a739e637a7bac9a3bf54927ee48f26c.webp?t=1784002233\" width=574 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, bond with, train, and breed your dream horse in StableBound — a horse life adventure where every horse has unique genetics, personalities, and potential. Explore vibrant landscapes, compete for rewards, discover rare horses, and build the stable you’ve always wanted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/84c011d8aec7a2cd6fd0095ac58f73e5.avif?t=1784002233\" width=681 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your horse and put your skills to the test in a variety of events. Earn rewards, gain experience, and strengthen your horse as you progress together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Compete in Dressage, Racing, Jumping, and Barrel Racing<br>• Earn currency and prizes<br>• Level up your horse through gameplay<br>• Improve stats including Speed, Strength, Agility, and Stamina<br>• Climb leaderboards and pursue champion status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/dda7461c30b5d350b1d5a1fcf03022f1.avif?t=1784002233\" width=759 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a stable filled with horses that feel alive. Care for their needs, strengthen your bond, and discover future generations through genetics-based breeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Feed, groom, and care for your horses<br>• Manage stable spaces and growing collections<br>• Breed horses with inherited genetics<br>• Discover rare colors, patterns, and combinations<br>• Watch personalities evolve as bonds deepen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/87ff2acf527bb22f5ef664953e22e6f8.avif?t=1784002233\" width=602 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander beautiful meadows and uncover surprises throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Catch new horses in the wild<br>• Discover hidden collectibles and dig spots<br>• Explore colorful environments<br>• Complete whims and activities<br>• Find rare rewards and secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/2438df7d6f1f4ae72bbe25d6acc86f42.webp?t=1784002233\" width=776 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create horses that feel uniquely yours with deep appearance options and genetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customize colors, markings, and patterns<br>• Discover genetics-based coat inheritance<br>• Unlock rare combinations<br>• Build your dream stable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725800/extras/3dc0599552dcbba8e0b4f89d5f4c75e9.webp?t=1784002233\" width=204 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both relaxing and rewarding gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Controller support<br>• Day/night at